{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんから頂いたお花を\nリハの前に見に行ってきたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なお花をたくさん\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ3公演目終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nイジリーさんが来てくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーみんな大好きイジリーさん＼^^／\nNOGIBINGO!4が始まって\nまたイジリーさんと\nお仕事できるので楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は昨日、\nアルコ＆ピースの酒井さん、\n安田大サーカスのクロちゃんさん\nが来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酒井さんは\n沈黙の金曜日の公開収録や\nALL LIVE NIPPONの時など\nらりん始め\nアンダーみんなお世話になってます！\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロちゃんさんは\nアイドル好きの先輩なので\nいつかアイドルのお話をできたらいいな\nって思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イジリーさんも、酒井さんも、クロちゃんさんも\n前回のアンダーライブのときも\n来てくださって\nまた来ていただけて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは\n玲香とかずみんと若月が来てくれたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか来てくれたメンバーに言われたことを書くの\nなんか恒例っぽくなってきちゃったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香には\n「ずっと見てたよ～！目で追っちゃってた」\n的な感じで言われました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんとは結構話せたんだけど\nライブのネタバレになっちゃいそうな事が\nいっぱいなので\n内緒にしときます( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nせいたんも来てくれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまだ卒業した感じがしない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれてありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブでメンバーが\n課題にしていたことは 歌 です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに届いたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はライブ中で\nアイドルはパフォーマンスしてなんぼでしょ\nって叫びました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたもこの言葉を胸に頑張ります！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらく の\n乃木坂46 Mobile会員限定の先行受付が\nもう始まってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"４月１９日（日）までなので\n観たい！ってかたは\n忘れないようにお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トリプルキャストということで\nチーム分けも発表されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が出演するのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6/19 19時\n6/20 17時\n6/21 13時\n6/24 19時\n6/28 13時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の5公演です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"把握お願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/16/9595828/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}